# Global git attributes, linked to ~/.gitattributes by git/install-hooks.sh,
# which bootstrap's devtools phase runs (`./bootstrap apply workstation`).
#
# Per-repository .gitattributes (written by `agents init`) takes precedence
# over anything here.
#
# The trace merge=union rule that used to live here retired with spec 7. It
# existed because two branches appending to the same tracked daily trace file
# produced conflict markers that are not valid JSON, which a line-oriented
# reader silently drops. The index is machine-local now -- nothing tracked
# appends concurrently -- so the rule had nothing left to defend.
#
# Deliberately empty of rules. The file itself stays: core.attributesFile
# points at it, and removing it would break that link rather than this rule.
